36. Failure Handling
Driver rejects
Reject
 ↓
Record attempt
 ↓
Exclude ambulance
 ↓
Fallback
Driver timeout
Timer expires
 ↓
Record timeout
 ↓
Exclude ambulance
 ↓
Fallback
Location update unavailable
No new location
 ↓
Last known location retained
 ↓
Mark update as stale
Route unavailable
Current route blocked
 ↓
Recalculate route
 ↓
Update ETA
No candidates
Candidate pool empty
 ↓
NO_AMBULANCE_AVAILABLE
